{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-arbor-view","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"arbor-view-ellington-arjan","about":"Arbor View - a 9-story complex in the Arjan neighborhood featuring studios and apartments with 1-3 bedrooms. All residences have a laundry room, balcony and storage, and some have a workspace. The interior features only natural materials and quality finishes. Through the luxurious panoramic windows and from the balconies of the residences you can admire the surrounding scenery.The project is located in a quiet green area, which combines amenities that allow future residents to lead a healthy lifestyle. Sports lovers will appreciate the yoga studio, gym, meditation capsules, as well as biking and jogging paths for walking among green spaces. For children, there is an outdoor themed playground and play area, as well as a children's pool. Arbor View residents will have access to a variety of on-site amenities. These include conference rooms and a luxurious lounge, a leisure pool, outdoor movie theater, lounge chairs, picnic and barbecue area, spa and sauna.Due to the convenient location of the complex, its residents will be able to easily reach other areas of Dubai. In walking distance are all important social infrastructure facilities: educational institutions, medical facilities, supermarkets.Arbour View is a place where residents can find the perfect balance of comfort, luxury and convenience. The complex offers an exceptional opportunity to experience the best of Dubai.","price":1496828,"title":"Arbor view","bitrix":{"id":485,"pf_id":"are.2.12802","source":null,"project_id":"Arbor View","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Arbor view","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"Ellington Properties","project_location":"Arjan"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/294/images/2023/06/26/340x252/juMCT8oCh66zDrHqH83Y0w55Q1Xl4xaYn